# As the desktop client's, DeepSeek's model form names where the selected
# model's requests go, and a saved OpenRouter key leads from the settings to
# OpenRouter's models, where Flash 4.1 through OpenRouter is one press.
expect "何に取り組みますか？" 30000
press モデル
press "DeepSeek Harness"
expect "選択中の送信先: DeepSeek公式" 20000
expect "OpenRouterのモデル一覧を表示"
expect_absent "OpenRouter経由のFlash 4.1を選択"
press アカウントと週間残量
press 接続先 10000
press OpenRouter
type APIキー "sk-or-fixture" after キーの発行ページ
press 保存
expect "保存済み（キーは非表示）" 20000
screenshot key
press OpenRouterのモデル一覧を開く
expect "OpenRouter · DeepSeek: DeepSeek V4.1 Flash" 20000
press "OpenRouter経由のFlash 4.1を選択"
expect "OpenRouter · Flash 4.1 選択中" 10000
expect "選択中の送信先: OpenRouter"
screenshot flash
